<%= @contest_description.name %>

Dear <%= @user.display_name_or_first_name_last_name %>,

Congratulations on your award for the <%= @contest_description.name %>.

YOUR ENTRY
=================
Title: <%= @entry.title %>
<% if @entry.category.present? %>Category: <%= @entry.category.kind %><% end %>
<% if @entry.award_status_label.present? %>Status: <%= @entry.award_status_label %><% end %>
<% if @entry.placement_label.present? %>Placement: <%= @entry.placement_label %><% end %>

<% if @primary_award || @add_on_awards.any? %>
YOUR AWARDS
=================
<% if @primary_award %>
* <%= @primary_award.award.name %><% if @include_amounts && @primary_award.amount.present? %> — <%= number_to_currency(@primary_award.amount) %><% end %>
<% end %>
<% @add_on_awards.each do |entry_award| %>
* <%= entry_award.award.name %><% if @include_amounts && entry_award.amount.present? %> — <%= number_to_currency(entry_award.amount) %><% end %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

We appreciate your work and hope you will stay involved in future contests.

<% if @contact_email.present? %>
If you have questions about this award, please contact <%= @contact_email %>.
<% end %>
